  unitName: Lightning Gun Rowgen
  unitId: 40475
  unitNumber: 692
  description: A gunner from another world who joined the God Army in their fight
    against the humans. Pledging his fealty to the gods, he fought in their army
    despite of his human origins, being charged with disposing of one of the Six
    Heroes, Lance. Though being aimed at from a blind-spot, Lance's Demon Pike Drevas
    was able to continuously defend all of Rowgen's attacks. However, the side-effects
    of using the Demon Pike for this type of defense required a lot of power from
    the user, which left Lance in quite a weakened state.
  summonDesc: The battle will never end.<br>As long as humans live, that is.<br>So
    I will take it upon myself...
  fusionDesc: The more power, the more<br>potential. Power calls for battle.<br>Heh,
    it's just nonsense.
  evoDesc: I know where I belong.<br>People become stronger with that.<br>We can
    see it in our dreams.
  element: 4
  rarity: 5
